Third-party notice: components derived from the `natural` npm package, version 8.1.1
(https://github.com/NaturalNode/natural), published under the MIT licence reproduced below.

- src/en/_porter.ts is a port of natural's lib/natural/stemmers/porter_stemmer.js
  (Copyright (c) 2011, Chris Umbel).
- models/natural/lexicon_from_posjs.json.gz and models/natural/tr_from_posjs.txt are natural's
  lib/natural/brill_pos_tagger/data/English/lexicon_from_posjs.json (gzipped) and
  tr_from_posjs.txt, unmodified. natural's README.txt for that directory records their origin:
  the lexicon is from https://github.com/dariusk/pos-js and the rules are derived from that
  project's BrillTransformationRules.js. pos-js states it is licensed under the GNU LGPLv3 and
  is a JavaScript port (Percy Wegmann) of Mark Watson's FastTag tagger, itself based on Eric
  Brill's trained rule set and English lexicon (Brill, "A simple rule-based part of speech
  tagger", ANLC 1992).
- src/en/_brill.ts is not derived from natural's tagger sources (which carry GPL-3.0 headers);
  it is an independent implementation of the same behaviour, verified by differential testing.

